{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1473899-ghosts-and-aging-in-chronicles-of-darkness","id":1473899,"title":"Ghosts and Aging in Chronicles of Darkness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-02-03T08:40:44-08:00","id":1473899,"title":"Ghosts and Aging in Chronicles of Darkness","content":"Okay, so back in the World of Darkness 1st edition ghosts gained a new Numen every 25 years or so of existence. is this not a thing anymore? Are ghosts just static after creation now? <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-03T09:57:33-08:00","id":1473903,"title":"","content":"Ghosts are very much not static- instead they have a Rank which can increase to 2 while they are bound to the material world and can go beyond it by becoming a Reaper or a Geist. Even if they don't fall to the Underworld they can change by trading memories as Absent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-03T10:27:02-08:00","id":1473905,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1473899-ghosts-and-aging-in-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1473903#post1473903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ghosts are very much not static- instead they have a Rank which can increase to 2 while they are bound to the material world and can go beyond it by becoming a Reaper or a Geist. Even if they don't fall to the Underworld they can change by trading memories as Absent.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a little bit of a misdirect.<br /> <br /> Ghost's aren't static in their growth progression, but it's not an inherent affair either. A ghost rising from Rank 1 to Rank 2 happens only with a handful of inciting incidents (a number of which are dependent on outside involvement from Sin-Eaters), Reapers only become rank 3 or higher with their Deathmask and otherwise operate at Rank 2 with privileges, and while drinking from the River's IS a way to increase in rank, a lot of Geists can't handle the psycho-substantial damage of doing that twice and often rely on alternative means that are made available to them with their newfound mobility.<br /> <br /> Ghost's Rank progression includes a lot of calcification and stagnation in line with the rest of the affairs of death. THey have a set of internal thresholds and barriers that lays parallel to the world's boundaries, their guardians and tolltakers, which is designed to invoke the aid of intercessors and psychopomps (the main ones being the Bound, but can include any of the other splats if they're specced for it, as well as Geists and Reapers).<br /> <br /> The hustle of the dead <i>does</i> offer sideways progression, and this is where they have the most agency-not only in trading Essence and Memory to keep up the sustenance and offer access to new abilities, but also allowing for EXP gain to invest in other features, including Numina and Influences, but let's not forget that it is all the act of hustling. A ghost who sits pretty and shivering cupped around their Anchor and relying on the steady trickle of life until those embers fade out is not going to slowly become more powerful over time.<br /> <br /> So they're not static, but they're not going to just passively accrue power either. You gotta fight to stay alive in this drowning death.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 02-03-2022, 01:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-03T13:23:17-08:00","id":1473921,"title":"","content":"I have to agree that I may have oversimplified it- yes, ghosts do not spontaneously change and need some action/stimulus to do so, but the fact they have the potential to change makes me to not view them as static entities. I think that the most static ones are angels, considering that their Rank is assigned by the God Machine and is not meant to fluctuate over time, and even they can Fall which means they do have a potential to change (even if it is unintended. Damn entropy ruins everything)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-03T14:36:20-08:00","id":1473933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1473899-ghosts-and-aging-in-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1473921#post1473921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to agree that I may have oversimplified it- yes, ghosts do not spontaneously change and need some action/stimulus to do so, but the fact they have the potential to change makes me to not view them as static entities. I think that the most static ones are angels, considering that their Rank is assigned by the God Machine and is not meant to fluctuate over time, and even they can Fall which means they do have a potential to change (even if it is unintended. Damn entropy ruins everything)</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah, the two most rigid and structured of the ranks are the God-Machine angels and the Goetia/Dreamborn of the Astral, and on the opposite end of the spectrum you have spirits with a lot of mobility provided your eyes (and teeth) are as big as your plate.<br /> <br /> That said, it IS important to note that Ghosts have a lot of Barriers to deal with. The lands of the dead of the dead are starving, lean, bitter places that will eat you piece by piece, the sort of environment that pushes people towards their worst inclinations and demands desperate answers for survival, and punishes sharply for getting the wrong answer.<br /> <br /> it may have more mobility than contemporaries, but for the ephemeral entity type that is the closest to humanity, it's <i>suffocatingly</i> limited and stagnant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-03T17:41:53-08:00","id":1473943,"title":"","content":"Thanks, y'all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-07T06:08:41-08:00","id":1474122,"title":"","content":"Huh. They really elaborated the ecology of the Underworld in Second Edition, didn't they? Geist is rising on my list of next thing to look at.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}